    {
      "rubric_id": "R1",
      "class": "decision-now",
      "severity": "non-blocking",
      "affected_surface": "P1a '--project' selector, SSD fallback filename 'runs.<scope_key>.json', P3 idle paths 'idle/<repo_key>/'",
      "claim": "Three key spellings are used without definition or with conflicting value types: 'runs --project <repo_identity>' versus 'runs --watch --project <key>' and the band hint 'run: autopilot status runs --watch --project <key>'; 'scope_key' is never defined; P3 uses 'repo_key' which exists nowhere in section 2.7.",
      "evidence": "P1a selectors: '--project <repo_identity>（只匹配有欄的 manifest）'; P1a watcher: '--watch --project <key>'; P1c: 'run: autopilot status runs --watch --project <key>'; SSD fallback: '~/.autopilot/review/<project_key>/live/runs.<scope_key>.json'; P3: 'idle/<repo_key>/<sid>.observed.json' and 'idle/<repo_key>/<sid>.declared.json'; section 2.7 lists only repo_identity and project_key for the project entity.",
      "evidence_reference": "section 4 P1a '選擇器' and 'watcher'; section 4 P1c first bullet; section 4 P3 '閒置兩種分欄'; section 2.7 rows 1-2",
      "repair": "In section 2.7 define scope_key = project_key when root is null, otherwise project_key + '--' + root_run_id; replace every 'repo_key' with project_key and state that hooks/idle-observe.js derives it in Node via project-key.js (hooks are not sandboxed). State that '--project' accepts either the full repo_identity string or a 16-hex project_key and normalises to project_key internally, or pick one form and use it in all three places.",
