    {
      "rubric_id": "R1",
      "class": "decision-now",
      "severity": "non-blocking",
      "affected_surface": "P1b gate-result matching rule (MATCH / 舊候選 / LIVE GATE)",
      "claim": "The MATCH rule makes branch equality a conjunct of the receipt-to-job join, which edges toward using branch as identity; the plan already locates receipts via the manifest ledger directory (a root-scoped key), so branch should be stated as a display filter only.",
      "evidence": "P1b: 'review receipt 從 manifest ledger 旁的 receipt-<phase>.json 發現' establishes the root-scoped join; then '匹配規則（G1 R3）：receipt 的 branch 等於 job 的 branch（manifest branch）且其最後一個 finalized chain[].head 是 candidate_commit 的祖先或相等 → MATCH'. Section 2.5 says branch may only be a display filter and must be labelled as such.",
      "evidence_reference": "section 4 P1b '輸入' and '匹配規則（G1 R3）'; section 2.5 identity bullet",
      "repair": "Reword: the join is ledger-directory membership plus the merge-base ancestor test against candidate_commit; branch mismatch is shown as a 'branch differs' chip on the row and never hides or demotes a receipt. Keep the LIVE GATE label as is. No code change beyond the renderer wording.",
