      "claim": "The version policy is explicit for the first mod (MINOR to 2.37.0) but P3 adds a new classic hook with an unspecified bump level ('2.37.<n>'), and P1a is labelled 'S→L' inline while the section 4 size line says L; neither blocks work but both are decisions the owner may expect to be fixed in the plan rather than at PR time.",
